            "mac_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> OSX 10.6+<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 512 MB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> REQUIRES X11 / XQuartz | Older Integrated Graphics may not function properly<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 80 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> You WILL need X11 to play Mighty Dungeons. You can get it from XQuartz. Set it to fullscreen X11 &gt; Preferences &gt; Output &gt; Colors [Millions] + [X] Full-screen mode and you are good to go! I will consider porting to another graphics engine for future releases.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> OSX 10.6+<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 2 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> REQUIRES X11 / XQuartz | Older Integrated Graphics may not function properly<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> You WILL need X11 to play Mighty Dungeons. You can get it from XQuartz. Set it to fullscreen X11 &gt; Preferences &gt; Output &gt; Colors [Millions] + [X] Full-screen mode and you are good to go! I will consider porting to another graphics engine for future releases.</li></ul>"
